" taskman v0.0.0              │                                                                                          "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"▾ tmp                        │                                    Welcome to taskman                                    "
" ─────────────────────────── │                                                                                          "
"   no tickets · ^a n         │               Press ctrl+a n to add an agent (or a ticket, with a tracker).              "
"                             │  Connect a tracker (Jira, Linear, GitHub Issues or Local files) for tickets, each in its "
"                             │                       own worktree with its issue and PR beside it.                      "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"                             │                                                                                          "
"                   ╭ Add ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮                   "
"                   │                                                                                │                   "
"                   │  Project   ‹ tmp ›                                                             │                   "
"                   │            ←/→ to change                                                       │                   "
"                   │  Type      ‹ Ticket ›                                                          │                   "
"                   │            a ticket's session, or an agent with no ticket                      │                   "
"                   │  Ticket                                                                        │                   "
"                   │            a number (ENG-12), a key, a link, or words from an open issue's     │                   "
"                   │            title                                                               │                   "
"                   │  CLI       ‹ Claude ›                                                          │                   "
"                   │            the coding CLI the session runs                                     │                   "
"                   │  Worktree  ‹ Create ›                                                          │                   "
"                   │            /tmp-ENG-52 on ENG-52-…                                             │                   "
"                   │  Base      ‹ main ›                                                            │                   "
"                   │            from origin/main; stacking needs another ticket with a branch       │                   "
"                   │                                                                                │                   "
"                   │                                                                                │                   "
"                   │  Enter save · Tab next field · ←/→ change choice · ctrl+u clear · Esc cancel   │                   "
